# DrumMania 3rd Mix and GuitarFreaks 4th Mix in session (with gtrfrk4m-session, run alongside: two
# processes on one session cable, runtime/sys573/link.h). Before the multi-session unit the two
# cabinets join SIO1 to SIO1; this side waits for the other (--session-host). From what
# drmn3m-install left: attract; two coins and Start at the title, and the GuitarFreaks cabinet joins
# (its WANTED screen); both pass the caution screen and the music select (Start every 300 frames)
# and play the first stage together ("Session"), on the pads: the snare every 8 frames, the hi-hat
# every 16, the bass drum every 12, a tom or the cymbal now and then. MAME can't run a session: this
# checks that two runs agree.
game drmn3m

at 4900 press "Coin 1" 8
at 4940 press "Coin 1" 8
at 5100 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 5400 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 5700 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 6000 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 6300 press "1 Player Start" 8
from 6500 every 8 press "Snare" 4
from 6504 every 16 press "Hi-Hat" 4
from 6502 every 12 press "Bass Drum" 4
from 6510 every 48 press "High Tom" 4
from 6534 every 48 press "Low Tom" 4
from 6550 every 96 press "Cymbal" 4
from 0 every 60 snap
at 12000 quit
